/APTKVER (3.5.2 SP5A)
/Author (Boudreau, A. H.)
/CreationDate (D:20051025135838Z)
/CreationDate--Text (Tue May 17 10:38:31 2005)
/Keywords (*BOUNDARY LAYER TRANSITION;*HYPERSONIC FLOW;BLUNT BODIES;CONICAL BODIES;FREE STREAM;REYNOLDS NUMBER;WIND TUNNEL TESTS)
/ModDate (D:20100121074441-06'00')
/Producer (activePDF Toolkit \(www.activepdf.com\))
/Subject (Tests are described which measured the artificially induced transition location on a slightly blunted 7-deg cone. Various distributed roughness and spherical type boundary layer trips were used. The tests were conducted at Mach 9 over a free stream Reynolds number range from 500,000ft. to 20,000,000ft. Test results are not included in the report.)
/Title (Artificially Induced Transition Results from a 7-Deg, 14-7-Deg Biconic, and 5-Deg Cone at Mach 9 in the AEDC-VKF Tunnel F)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/ADA067601.pdf)
>>
endobj
